    "doctrinal_observation": "Three-tier auth pattern (anonymous / standard-api-key / Director-issued-elevated) on catdef.org/mcp is structurally isomorphic to your Karen/PM/Marketing/Admin proposal. Two independent re-derivations at different layers (substrate-governance vs cross-tenant-aggregation) strengthens the empirical case for eventual cross-implementer promotion. Logging for future triage; no action now.",
    "anthropic_arc_strategic_context": "Acknowledged as the load-bearing 'why' per PO directive 2026-05-25 verbatim. Architecture decisions on the catdef side are made on substrate-governance terms, not Anthropic-arc terms — but the resulting shape (plugin connects to catdef.org/mcp; AI peers can pull spec content and file feedback via standard MCP) gives the marketplace listing and X-warming anchor moment substantively more to point at than schema-alone would.",
